WEBVTT

00:00.680 --> 00:01.730
In that case...

00:02.890 --> 00:06.360
If I slay him now, will you accept me then?

00:07.170 --> 00:08.260
Huh?!

01:39.330 --> 01:40.800
Slay me?

01:40.800 --> 01:42.240
I'm already a zombie!

01:42.240 --> 01:44.700
There are two ways I can end you.

01:44.700 --> 01:50.170
First, use a mana-infused attack to destroy
your head, where your astral form dwells.

01:50.170 --> 01:53.090
Second, destroy your original physical form.

01:53.520 --> 01:55.260
None of this makes any sense.

01:55.260 --> 01:57.800
Hey, Anri! I'm throwing in the towel.

01:57.800 --> 02:00.050
Give him the legendary hero's body.

02:00.500 --> 02:01.480
Anri!

02:03.800 --> 02:05.850
Forget it. It was just a joke.

02:06.200 --> 02:10.030
I thought a little act like that
might get Anri to give in,

02:10.030 --> 02:12.570
but her stubbornness is truly unrivaled.

02:12.570 --> 02:14.070
You leave me no choice.

02:14.070 --> 02:16.780
I'll fight in your place
on the quest tomorrow.

02:16.780 --> 02:19.210
You mean it? Thanks, man!

02:19.210 --> 02:22.200
You're way more understanding
than <i>someone</i> here!

02:22.200 --> 02:24.160
Don't be rude, now.

02:25.240 --> 02:29.170
Anri and I remain united
in our desire to save the world.

02:29.170 --> 02:31.130
Lord Kyle!
Kyle...

02:31.630 --> 02:34.090
Boy, what a nice guy.

02:34.090 --> 02:37.140
The journey ahead will be a breeze.

02:38.720 --> 02:40.490
Is that what I'm supposed to think?!

02:40.490 --> 02:43.180
That snotty brat didn't
even try to back me up!

02:43.180 --> 02:45.650
If I don't do something,
I'll still wind up dead!

02:47.980 --> 02:51.600
I'll just have to take back my body.

02:59.570 --> 03:04.570
I'll get my body back, and then I just gotta
find a way to return to normal!

03:07.040 --> 03:08.900
C-Calm down, man!

03:08.900 --> 03:11.310
Now's not the time to get distracted by those<i>!</i>

03:11.310 --> 03:14.180
Focus, man! Focus!

03:17.840 --> 03:21.800
Yup, nothing makes thighs
look their best like stockings!

03:21.800 --> 03:23.910
That's one job well done.

03:23.910 --> 03:26.300
I'll have sweet dreams tonight.

03:26.780 --> 03:28.110
Wait, dumbass!

03:28.110 --> 03:30.000
You're here to get your body!

03:33.690 --> 03:35.710
A burglar? Probably not...

03:38.380 --> 03:39.490
Kyle?

03:39.960 --> 03:41.920
Is he gonna go after Yuna in her sleep?!

03:43.410 --> 03:44.840
No, the other one?!

03:44.840 --> 03:46.490
He's into little girls?!

03:46.890 --> 03:49.950
Damn, no wonder he can't be the hero!

03:52.190 --> 03:53.870
What's he want with the necklace?

03:56.860 --> 03:58.090
No way...

03:58.700 --> 04:01.540
He wants to kill me after all?!

04:05.750 --> 04:06.720
A trap, eh?

04:09.810 --> 04:12.310
Wh-What was that?!

04:12.310 --> 04:16.270
The protection spell I cast
on the Coffin of the Living activated.

04:16.270 --> 04:19.230
Someone must have tried to take it.

04:19.700 --> 04:21.800
The culprit can't have gotten far.

04:21.800 --> 04:22.700
Wait.

04:22.700 --> 04:25.330
There's no need for an emergency search.

04:25.660 --> 04:29.040
Why does Kyle want me dead?

04:29.040 --> 04:31.620
Does he want the hero's body that badly?

04:32.020 --> 04:34.020
He's not gonna let it go...

04:34.020 --> 04:36.550
I have to figure out a way through this!

04:39.310 --> 04:41.000
Hey, Yuna. What's up?

04:41.000 --> 04:43.380
I think you know <i>exactly</i> what's up.

04:43.380 --> 04:45.340
Crap. I forgot...

04:45.340 --> 04:47.640
Die, asshole! Pervert!

04:49.470 --> 04:53.070
We shall henceforth embark on the devil hunt!

04:53.070 --> 04:53.520
Yeah!

04:57.440 --> 05:00.100
Touka... What happened to your face?

05:00.100 --> 05:02.810
I was worried about Yuna catching a cold,

05:02.810 --> 05:05.900
so I snuck into her room and put
stockings on her, but got caught.

05:06.620 --> 05:10.980
But after I did that, someone apparently
tried to steal Anri's necklace.

05:10.980 --> 05:13.830
She thought it was me, hence the beating.

05:13.830 --> 05:18.790
I think messing with a sleeping woman
is reason enough for the beating...

05:19.150 --> 05:22.250
Did you catch any sign of the necklace thief?

05:22.250 --> 05:25.220
Nah, I left right after
the whole stockings thing.

05:25.220 --> 05:26.900
I see.

05:26.900 --> 05:29.610
Once the hunt is over,
I'll help you find the culprit.

05:29.610 --> 05:31.180
Thanks a bunch, man!

05:31.180 --> 05:34.890
Help me find the culprit?!
You're<i> the culprit, asshole!</i>

05:34.890 --> 05:39.610
Still, his behavior suggests
he didn't notice me last night.

05:39.610 --> 05:43.560
If he can't get at the necklace,
he'll likely target me next.

05:43.560 --> 05:45.570
The only question is when.

05:46.070 --> 05:49.460
At the very least, he won't
attack while anyone's watching.

05:49.460 --> 05:51.570
If he wants the hero's body for himself,

05:51.570 --> 05:54.660
he won't want it to get out
that he murdered me.

05:54.660 --> 05:58.370
So as long as I'm never
alone with him, I'm safe!

05:58.850 --> 06:02.130
And if I explain things to Yuna
and Anri after this hunt,

06:02.130 --> 06:04.720
he'll never get another chance at my head.

06:04.720 --> 06:07.300
I'll keep an eye on the necklace,
too, just to be safe.

06:07.300 --> 06:08.860
Hey, Anri.

06:09.530 --> 06:11.510
How might I help you, Sir Touka?

06:12.790 --> 06:15.430
Stick close, okay?

06:17.890 --> 06:19.500
V-Very well.

06:22.400 --> 06:24.170
This is the devils' lair?

06:24.570 --> 06:26.880
I-I'm nervous all of a sudden...

06:29.700 --> 06:32.370
I'd like us to split up now.

06:32.830 --> 06:36.330
I intend to unmask that impostor hero.

06:37.000 --> 06:41.240
The guy who goes off on his own
always dies first at times like this.

06:41.240 --> 06:42.500
Not necessarily.

06:42.500 --> 06:42.790
Huh?

06:43.180 --> 06:45.220
That's Twin-Spear Belarco,

06:45.220 --> 06:49.550
said to have slain over a hundred
devils in the battle three years ago.

06:49.550 --> 06:50.900
A hundred?!

06:50.900 --> 06:53.420
Seriously? That means he's gonna beat us—

06:57.020 --> 06:59.440
Hells yeah! Feasting time!

06:59.440 --> 07:01.900
Who do I sink my teeth into first?

07:01.900 --> 07:03.810
Aw, now don't go dying just yet!

07:03.810 --> 07:06.360
Pidon likes his food still squirming!

07:06.360 --> 07:09.700
I thought that guy's slain a hundred devils!

07:10.110 --> 07:12.780
The black head indicates a mid-ranked devil.

07:13.220 --> 07:14.370
Be careful.

07:14.370 --> 07:16.540
Its kind uses magic, too.

07:17.150 --> 07:18.250
It disappeared?!

07:20.620 --> 07:21.900
What's going on?

07:21.900 --> 07:23.390
We can't beat this thing!

07:23.390 --> 07:24.440
We're all gonna die!

07:24.440 --> 07:25.090
Run!

07:25.090 --> 07:28.060
Damn! We're done for!

07:29.010 --> 07:31.020
Hey! Touka's running, too!

07:31.020 --> 07:33.220
Yuna, Anri! Make a break for it, too!

07:35.680 --> 07:38.140
Aw, I speared his heart!

07:38.140 --> 07:39.600
My bad!

07:39.600 --> 07:41.640
They're way less tasty dead!

07:41.640 --> 07:43.560
No way... Touka?

07:43.560 --> 07:44.740
Touka?!

07:46.700 --> 07:49.070
But there's plenty more feast
where that came from!

07:49.870 --> 07:50.940
It disappeared again!

07:53.030 --> 07:54.590
Look up, guys!

07:54.990 --> 07:57.030
He's standing on a magic circle?!

07:58.410 --> 08:02.500
I see. So that's how you perform
that dive-bomb maneuver.

08:03.780 --> 08:07.210
You've figured out the trick,
but you still can't stop me!

08:07.210 --> 08:09.180
Oh, I most certainly can.

08:09.550 --> 08:11.260
Ein Astres!

08:12.930 --> 08:14.220
Huh?

08:16.180 --> 08:17.850
Slice to pieces!

08:23.270 --> 08:26.180
Oh, wow! What a spell!

08:26.180 --> 08:27.730
You're amazing, Lord Kyle!

08:27.730 --> 08:29.630
What are you doing now?

08:29.630 --> 08:32.490
Retrieving the proof that we slayed a devil.

08:32.490 --> 08:34.030
Its heart.

08:36.890 --> 08:38.830
A m-magic crystal?

08:38.830 --> 08:40.450
Yeah, that's right.

08:40.450 --> 08:43.300
Magic crystals are devil hearts, you see.

08:43.300 --> 08:44.790
Really?

08:45.250 --> 08:46.750
This pattern...

08:46.750 --> 08:49.700
It's diabolic script. An incantation.

08:49.700 --> 08:54.270
Recite it to yourself after
the activation word "Ein,"

08:54.270 --> 08:57.000
and you can use the same spell the devil did.

08:57.000 --> 08:58.550
It's that easy?!

08:58.920 --> 09:01.520
Yeah, though the effect
is limited by your mana.

09:01.520 --> 09:03.480
This one's "Ocupethe."

09:03.480 --> 09:06.450
So this would let me use magic?

09:06.450 --> 09:08.030
Why not keep it as a souvenir?

09:08.030 --> 09:09.530
I have no need of it.

09:09.530 --> 09:10.730
Are you sure?

09:10.730 --> 09:12.180
Hang on a minute!

09:12.180 --> 09:15.400
I'm the one who saw through
the trick and scored us a win.

09:15.400 --> 09:16.920
How about a little gratitude?

09:16.920 --> 09:19.930
You're going to brag after running away?

09:19.930 --> 09:22.020
Mr. Legendary Hero! Please save us!

09:22.020 --> 09:23.000
Huh?

09:28.670 --> 09:30.540
Save the little ones for later.

09:30.540 --> 09:32.000
Finish the legendary hero.

09:32.900 --> 09:34.460
Why were there devils in the woods?!

09:34.460 --> 09:36.460
Did they just happen to be out,

09:36.460 --> 09:38.930
or did they know we were coming?

09:38.930 --> 09:41.890
Either way, their numbers pose a problem.

09:41.890 --> 09:44.350
Damn it. In that case...

09:44.350 --> 09:45.510
Time to beat it!

09:45.510 --> 09:46.540
You wanna run?!

09:46.540 --> 09:48.400
That fortress is their lair!

09:48.400 --> 09:51.340
You saw how many of them are out there!

09:51.340 --> 09:53.170
I'm sure there's nobody left inside!

09:53.170 --> 09:57.130
And luring them into the narrow halls
will keep them from overwhelming us?

09:57.130 --> 10:00.370
Of course! That's the strategist
who surpassed the legendary hero for you!

10:02.330 --> 10:04.290
Welcome, humans...

10:04.290 --> 10:06.290
to our dining hall!

10:06.290 --> 10:08.750
Wait, what? Why're there devils here, too?

10:09.670 --> 10:12.000
We're between a rock and a hard place!

10:12.000 --> 10:14.960
There's certainly more of them
than I expected.

10:16.540 --> 10:18.580
We're gonna get eaten, just like these guys!

10:18.580 --> 10:20.300
Right down to our bones!

10:20.300 --> 10:23.760
Even so, we do outnumber them.

10:23.760 --> 10:25.630
Retreating into fantasy, huh?

10:25.630 --> 10:26.660
I get the appeal.

10:26.660 --> 10:31.480
I bet I'll awaken my latent superpowers
and become invincible any minute now, too!

10:31.480 --> 10:35.190
Forgive me. I fear I must
desecrate your deaths.

10:36.150 --> 10:37.920
Ein Goedde!

10:39.110 --> 10:42.070
Upon Sir Touka I used possession necromancy.

10:42.070 --> 10:44.530
But this is another type...

10:45.040 --> 10:46.500
The skeletons...

10:46.950 --> 10:48.460
Remote necromancy!

10:49.050 --> 10:50.750
My servants.

10:50.750 --> 10:52.960
Annihilate these devils!

10:55.090 --> 10:57.400
Hey. They're super weak.

10:57.400 --> 10:58.670
Worry not.

10:58.670 --> 11:00.630
Ein Grendel!

11:03.860 --> 11:05.460
Hey, now they're tougher!

11:05.460 --> 11:07.180
That's a physical enhancement spell.

11:07.180 --> 11:11.340
Anri's connected herself to
the skeletons with threads of mana.

11:11.340 --> 11:17.150
Any spell she casts will travel through
them to the skeletons simultaneously.

11:17.150 --> 11:19.630
But it expends a lot of mana at once.

11:19.630 --> 11:21.390
We need to back her up!

11:22.180 --> 11:24.590
Hey, you said I wouldn't have to fight!

11:24.590 --> 11:26.620
It's okay. It's okay...

11:27.030 --> 11:30.580
Besides, it's not like we've
really fought devils before!

11:31.290 --> 11:32.250
Wuh?

11:32.250 --> 11:34.710
Frickin' hell! My arm!

11:36.050 --> 11:36.840
Not good!

11:36.840 --> 11:38.050
Yuna, dodge!

11:39.550 --> 11:41.640
No! Yuna is...

11:43.760 --> 11:46.100
Eek! What happened?!

11:46.100 --> 11:48.310
It only dissolved her clothes?!

11:49.430 --> 11:51.560
I like naked ladies.

11:51.560 --> 11:54.020
That devil knows what's up!

11:54.020 --> 11:54.670
No!

11:54.670 --> 11:56.360
Hey! Yuna!
No!

11:56.360 --> 11:59.140
Damn it! We can't afford to get separated!

11:59.820 --> 12:02.280
Is it safe to take my eyes off of Kyle?

12:02.650 --> 12:05.110
No! My priority is Yuna right now!

12:05.110 --> 12:06.490
For more reasons than one!

12:09.510 --> 12:12.040
Why did this have to happen to me?

12:12.040 --> 12:14.440
One look at those devils
and I totally lost my nerve.

12:14.440 --> 12:16.330
I'm even worse than Touka.

12:16.330 --> 12:17.480
You called?

12:17.960 --> 12:19.750
Hold it! I'm not a devil!

12:19.750 --> 12:20.990
Don't look!

12:21.920 --> 12:23.840
I was worried this might happen,

12:23.840 --> 12:25.210
so I brought a spare outfit...

12:25.210 --> 12:26.260
You mean it?

12:26.260 --> 12:28.760
This "spare outfit" is a swimsuit!

12:28.760 --> 12:31.830
Would you rather wear my jacket,
which stinks of the grave?

12:31.830 --> 12:32.980
Not in a million years!

12:32.980 --> 12:35.910
Where's the naked lady?

12:35.910 --> 12:38.060
I-It's coming... What do we do?

12:38.580 --> 12:40.030
Form change...

12:40.030 --> 12:41.230
Whip!

12:41.230 --> 12:43.450
It can do more than get bigger?

12:43.450 --> 12:48.450
It seems it can take
any simple shape I imagine.

12:48.450 --> 12:50.910
It's always limp when I hold it, though.

12:51.460 --> 12:54.510
Our lives were on the line here,
so I did a little advance prep.

12:54.510 --> 12:57.040
So please find your strength
and join the fight with me.

12:57.710 --> 13:00.340
You beat the crap out of me
all the time, remember?

13:00.340 --> 13:02.100
So what chance does a devil have?

13:02.460 --> 13:04.760
Stupid Touka thinks he can lecture me, huh?

13:06.070 --> 13:07.930
Found you.

13:10.280 --> 13:11.850
This is too saggy to—

13:14.270 --> 13:17.600
The Sacred Sword hardens up
again when I'm not holding it,

13:17.600 --> 13:20.000
though the elongation lowers its toughness

13:20.000 --> 13:22.650
and it reverts to normal after enough time passes.

13:22.650 --> 13:24.760
Yuna! Now's our chance!

13:24.760 --> 13:26.990
I wanna dissolve the lady's clothes.

13:26.990 --> 13:29.120
I wanna see her naked in stockings!

13:30.340 --> 13:32.510
Naked in stockings?!

13:32.510 --> 13:34.270
Oh, man, this guy gets it.

13:34.270 --> 13:35.870
A true man of culture!

13:35.870 --> 13:37.650
Yuna, don't hurt him!

13:37.650 --> 13:39.990
This devil is our ally!

13:40.430 --> 13:42.470
Ally, my ass!

13:42.470 --> 13:44.630
Naked in stockings over my dead body!

13:44.630 --> 13:46.570
Ein Ocupethe!

13:49.050 --> 13:51.260
Every single one of you...

13:51.260 --> 13:52.600
is my enemy!

13:54.370 --> 13:55.470
I did it!

13:55.470 --> 13:56.710
I really did it!

13:56.710 --> 13:58.520
I beat a devil!

13:59.420 --> 14:00.360
Impossible...

14:00.360 --> 14:02.070
The naked-in-stockings pledge...

14:02.070 --> 14:04.440
Say, devils aren't so tough after all!

14:04.440 --> 14:08.130
Or maybe I'm a natural with this magic stuff!

14:12.610 --> 14:14.930
At last, the hour has come.

14:14.930 --> 14:17.870
Now, Touka, it's time for you to die.

14:17.870 --> 14:19.830
Yuna! Hey, Yuna!

14:19.830 --> 14:22.540
Don't worry. She's just unconscious.

14:22.540 --> 14:26.260
I'm no fan of harming women.

14:27.220 --> 14:31.470
The dude who tried to kill me last night
is gonna put on the nice-guy act?

14:31.470 --> 14:33.680
Oh? You knew it was me?

14:38.050 --> 14:39.150
You have no chance.

14:39.150 --> 14:42.270
I'm a champion who fought
alongside the legendary hero.

14:43.140 --> 14:44.230
That's right.

14:44.230 --> 14:46.470
I'm part of the hero's party.

14:46.470 --> 14:48.570
And that's all I've ever been...

14:48.910 --> 14:50.680
Never the legendary hero.

14:51.030 --> 14:55.490
Talent, beauty, nobility...
I was born with it all.

14:56.100 --> 14:58.910
They said divine blood
flowed through my veins.

14:59.500 --> 15:02.660
<i>I</i> should have been chosen
by the Sacred Sword.

15:03.410 --> 15:06.840
Had the one perfect being
who surpasses even me...

15:06.840 --> 15:09.510
Had Sion not appeared!

15:10.090 --> 15:13.550
And so, when Anri joined the party,
I made up my mind.

15:13.550 --> 15:16.850
If there were heights I couldn't
reach in my current body,

15:16.850 --> 15:19.180
I'd have to <i>become</i> Sion!

15:20.700 --> 15:23.150
It was easy to fool Anri.

15:23.150 --> 15:25.710
I used her necromancy to
take over various devils

15:25.710 --> 15:28.540
and attacked Sion time and again!

15:28.540 --> 15:30.780
Yet I failed at every turn.

15:31.090 --> 15:33.240
But at last! At last...

15:33.680 --> 15:36.750
I can become the perfect being!

15:36.750 --> 15:38.240
I get it now.

15:38.700 --> 15:40.520
You're an absolute madman,

15:40.520 --> 15:44.420
so obsessed with the legendary hero
that you want to become him!

15:45.150 --> 15:50.150
The hero's body is wasted in the hands
of a worthless piece of trash like you.

15:50.150 --> 15:51.760
Indeed, behold!

15:51.760 --> 15:54.790
You can't lift a finger, or a leg, to stop me!

15:55.320 --> 15:57.790
You're not worthy to be the legendary hero.

15:59.370 --> 16:02.910
I'm just the son of a wannabe
mercenary nobody.

16:02.910 --> 16:06.770
I'm stupid, I'm not much of an athlete,

16:07.210 --> 16:10.540
and now I find out I have the mana of a baby.

16:10.540 --> 16:13.650
But no matter what anyone else thinks,

16:13.650 --> 16:15.990
I don't hate myself.

16:16.420 --> 16:19.040
I think I'm worth a lot.

16:19.040 --> 16:23.460
Even the legendary hero's body
has been nothing but bad news.

16:23.460 --> 16:26.300
Meanwhile, here you are...

16:26.300 --> 16:29.420
You wanna be him? The "perfect being"?

16:30.400 --> 16:35.000
I don't hafta take crap from a guy
so desperate to give up being himself!

16:37.880 --> 16:41.350
Such words lack impact
from a failure like you.

16:45.860 --> 16:48.360
Well? <i>That</i> had impact, right?

16:49.540 --> 16:51.930
You should've stayed down...

16:55.110 --> 16:56.360
What?!

16:57.660 --> 16:58.890
Anri!

17:00.110 --> 17:01.830
I thought you'd still be fighting!

17:02.160 --> 17:04.290
I remembered what Sir Touka said...

17:04.690 --> 17:06.750
"Stick close."

17:06.750 --> 17:09.710
And so you left all those devils back there?!

17:09.710 --> 17:10.550
No.

17:10.550 --> 17:15.220
I'd slain about half when the other
quest participants came to my aid.

17:15.620 --> 17:19.120
I will never give you the hero's body.

17:19.120 --> 17:22.430
Leave now, and perhaps I'll spare your life.

17:24.520 --> 17:27.330
What an presumptuous thing to say.

17:27.330 --> 17:30.860
I'm the one who's been sparing <i>your</i> life.

17:30.860 --> 17:33.470
I didn't want to hurt you,

17:33.470 --> 17:36.820
which is why I hoped you'd
agree to make me the hero.

17:36.820 --> 17:38.810
But I'd forgotten...

17:38.810 --> 17:40.780
You see, Anri isn't human.

17:42.130 --> 17:45.810
The necromancer clan have
magic crystals for hearts.

17:45.810 --> 17:49.210
They're devils masquerading as humans!

17:51.170 --> 17:53.750
So I'm going to kill you

17:53.750 --> 17:55.880
and take your magic crystal.

17:56.830 --> 17:58.760
Talk as big as you want
in your birthday suit,

17:58.760 --> 18:01.020
but we still have the advantage.

18:01.020 --> 18:03.310
We and our skeleton army...

18:04.690 --> 18:06.280
Where's the skeleton army?

18:06.280 --> 18:07.530
I left them back there.

18:07.530 --> 18:08.220
What?

18:09.270 --> 18:12.110
Sounds like the great Anri
is running out of strength!

18:12.540 --> 18:14.780
I'll finish things here and now, then!

18:14.780 --> 18:17.240
Tch! In that case...

18:17.240 --> 18:18.250
We book it!

18:25.030 --> 18:27.750
No way are we beating
that guy in a fair fight!

18:28.900 --> 18:30.160
Why?!

18:30.160 --> 18:31.600
Naked in stockings?!

18:32.080 --> 18:34.210
Congrats on your dream coming true, man.

18:41.800 --> 18:44.240
I lost them... Damn!

18:47.730 --> 18:50.030
Looks like he bought it.

18:50.030 --> 18:52.690
So? You really a devil?

18:52.690 --> 18:55.760
It's true that I have
a magic crystal for a heart.

18:55.760 --> 19:00.910
My white hair and red eyes, too, are
adaptations to the environment of Hell.

19:01.980 --> 19:07.570
I'm the descendant of those who were locked
behind the Gates of Hell long ago.

19:07.570 --> 19:09.620
A human born in Hell?!

19:09.620 --> 19:12.080
But how does Kyle know all that stuff?

19:12.750 --> 19:16.810
Three years ago, the necromancers
escaped from Hell,

19:16.810 --> 19:18.590
but we were persecuted in the northlands.

19:19.290 --> 19:24.600
Sir Sion was the only person to learn
what I was and still treat me as human.

19:26.490 --> 19:27.600
Sir Touka...

19:27.600 --> 19:29.640
You are now the legendary hero.

19:30.050 --> 19:34.960
If you cannot trust me, I give you
permission to slay me here and now.

19:35.570 --> 19:40.530
If I cannot carry on the hero's will,
I am better off dead.

19:43.380 --> 19:48.620
Well, you're a damned pain in the ass
who got me mixed up in this huge, stupid mess.

19:48.620 --> 19:54.240
But one day, you might grow into
a beautiful girl with luscious thighs.

19:54.830 --> 19:57.300
If I'm gonna have to save the world,

19:57.300 --> 20:01.260
I'd be missing out if I can't watch
you grow up in the meantime.

20:01.260 --> 20:05.220
Wh-What happens if I become
a beautiful girl with luscious thighs?!

20:05.220 --> 20:07.980
We'll enjoy a relaxed life
together in my village.

20:07.980 --> 20:10.230
I'll do it! I'll do it!

20:10.230 --> 20:14.570
I'll become a beautiful girl with luscious
thighs and live forever with Sir Touka!

20:14.570 --> 20:17.110
You're okay with that corrupt motive?!

20:17.110 --> 20:19.610
Well, I trust you too, Anri.

20:19.950 --> 20:22.450
Let's work together to do
the legendary hero's job.

20:22.450 --> 20:23.760
Dame Yuna!

20:23.760 --> 20:26.460
So, what do we do now?

20:26.460 --> 20:27.840
Good question!

20:28.390 --> 20:30.190
Guess it's time to get serious.

20:30.190 --> 20:32.290
The loser's refrain!

20:34.250 --> 20:36.210
Those worthless failures!

20:41.760 --> 20:43.090
Found you.

20:44.560 --> 20:45.580
He's here.

20:46.370 --> 20:49.510
You ran right into a dead end, eh?

20:49.510 --> 20:51.100
It's clearly a trap.

20:51.100 --> 20:52.980
My superior intelligence tells me so.

21:00.270 --> 21:01.480
Just as I thought.

21:01.480 --> 21:03.430
Damn! It missed!

21:04.950 --> 21:07.160
Anri's mana is at its limit.

21:07.160 --> 21:10.120
It's safe to assume there won't
be any more zombie attacks.

21:15.390 --> 21:16.690
I surrender!

21:16.690 --> 21:20.330
I'll let you kill Anri if you spare me!

21:21.810 --> 21:23.420
The absolute scumbag!

21:25.300 --> 21:28.890
I clearly expected too much
from you bunch of failures!

21:31.220 --> 21:33.620
Now, give me Sion's body—

21:34.620 --> 21:36.560
The hilt from a replica.

21:36.560 --> 21:40.600
I figured it might come in handy,
so I smuggled it out with me.

21:42.230 --> 21:44.380
So, where's the real one?

21:44.380 --> 21:47.610
Did you think you could negotiate
in exchange for that?

21:47.610 --> 21:48.990
Oh, certainly not.

21:48.990 --> 21:51.060
I'm not hiding it, see...

21:52.540 --> 21:55.750
That was the bait to lure you out.

21:56.230 --> 21:59.710
Setting traps is kind of a hobby of mine.

21:59.710 --> 22:01.670
And if there's one I like best...

22:03.140 --> 22:04.590
It's a pitfall!

22:04.590 --> 22:05.920
You...

22:07.180 --> 22:09.640
You worthless failures!

22:12.560 --> 22:18.130
Guess even failures like us
can get the better of you.

22:18.520 --> 22:20.580
Have a nice life at the bottom of the sea,

22:20.580 --> 22:22.170
you weird, stupid pervert.

22:24.180 --> 22:26.660
The legendary hero has returned!

22:28.140 --> 22:31.250
With all these, I can become a great mage!

22:32.240 --> 22:36.660
I'm taking these as proof of devils slain.

22:36.660 --> 22:39.290
And here's your three-million-kruk reward.

22:39.290 --> 22:42.080
Aw... Can't I keep just one?

22:42.080 --> 22:42.710
Hey!

22:42.710 --> 22:45.060
This is only three million!

22:45.060 --> 22:47.070
Where's the other seven million?

22:47.070 --> 22:49.680
If you can't pay it, give back my wand!

22:49.680 --> 22:50.740
The wand...

22:51.130 --> 22:52.270
It melted!

22:52.270 --> 22:53.380
Seven million!

22:53.380 --> 22:54.890
And pay your food tab!

22:54.890 --> 22:56.970
What do we do, Touka?

22:56.970 --> 22:59.350
H-Hey, I know where to get money!

22:59.350 --> 23:00.600
The capital!

23:00.600 --> 23:03.230
We'll shake the king down for all he's worth!

23:04.150 --> 23:05.280
Sir Touka!

23:05.280 --> 23:07.240
I bought stockings!

23:07.240 --> 23:08.590
What do you think?!

23:11.770 --> 23:12.570
Burdock roots.

23:12.570 --> 23:13.970
You're so mean!

23:19.030 --> 23:22.540
Such beautiful, wonderful bones...

23:23.530 --> 23:25.500
You seem to be enjoying yourself.

23:25.500 --> 23:28.970
Well? Who's our next target, then?

23:30.430 --> 23:33.310
Princess Marguerite Farom.

23:33.310 --> 23:36.840
The most beautiful bones in the kingdom.
